        "content": "<html><body>\nAlert Smart Horizons - IAP Prod - Mali Newsletter<p> </p>            <br/>\n<p><img alt=\"logo_newsletter\" height=\"127\" id=\"_x0000_i1025\" src=\"cid:image001.jpg@01D833A1.3AE8DBC0\" style=\"width:3.3333in;height:1.3229in\" width=\"320\"/></p>                  <br/>\nOpen Sources Research Division                  <br/>\nMali Newsletter                  <br/>\n09-03-2022                <br/>\n            <br/>\n            <br/>\n         <br/>\n       <br/>\n<p> </p><p> </p>                <br/>\n<p> </p>                  <br/>\nTABLE OF CONTENTS                <br/>\n<p> </p><p> </p>                <br/>\n<p> </p>                      <br/>\nTop Stories\n                    <br/>\n<p><a href=\"\">Mali-Russie : Sadio Camara et Alou Boï Diarra en mission secrète à Moscou\n</a></p>                        <br/>\n                        <br/>\n                    <br/>\n<p><a href=\"\">Mali : ce que l on sait sur le charnier de Niono\n</a></p>                        <br/>\n                        <br/>\n                    <br/>\n                      <br/>\nOthers\n                    <br/>\n<p><a href=\"\">Jeune Afrique denounces fake front page praising Mali army\n</a></p>                        <br/>\n                        <br/>\n                    <br/>\n<p><a href=\"\">Malian Army Accused of Killings, Denies Culpability\n</a></p>                        <br/>\n                        <br/>\n                    <br/>\n<p><a href=\"\">Mauritania accuses Mali&apos;s army of &quot;crimes&quot;\n</a></p>                        <br/>\n                        <br/>\n                    <br/>\n<p><a href=\"\">La Mauritanie accuse l&apos;armée malienne de crimes &quot;récurrents&quot; contre ses ressortissants\n</a></p>                        <br/>\n                        <br/>\n                    <br/>\n<p><a href=\"\">Attaque de Mondoro au Mali: les jihadistes du Jnim et Bamako présentent des bilans différents\n</a></p>                        <br/>\n                        <br/>\n                    <br/>\n<p><a href=\"\">La Mauritanie en colère après des disparitions à la frontière avec le Mali\n</a></p>                        <br/>\n                        <br/>\n                    <br/>\n<p><a href=\"\">Mauritania summons Malian envoy over alleged killing of its nationals in Mali\n</a></p>                        <br/>\n                        <br/>\n                    <br/>\n<p><a href=\"\">Peacekeepers and soldiers killed in attacks in Mali\n</a></p>                        <br/>\n                        <br/>\n                    <br/>\n                <br/>\n<p> </p><p> </p>                <br/>\n                <br/>\n                  <br/>\nTop Stories\n                <br/>\n<p><a href=\"https://iap-cloud.amisw.com/nlt/?cc=A2M4aCAgrU3Y6xXVg7WhVmc72YDvEHJD0B8k-WOE0293vJuYTVe2FxizjRMVYJxDLQ-MhBfEyXMuFXxo12acThPkZBFSLrsXfJeE0A8cFGbAk6IBVKup9GAlogQhak-wY5UwNMgatyQU-dvoRxcaVNwMUEmnlxbO_TLfJ2Untkvc9j032V_r5sXRTvPGMKdA6RsM9fBQ7zlAy73_EkqLUoBQoluvVx45s_zTR4ov2vpVp78CZ8FRopiTKwZ5rb0c7ZND-RfomTx_0BBhiOYtImx2nvKJfk-ADUhlvgn78fCG-zx8_qs\"></a></p>                  <br/>\n<a href=\"https://iap-cloud.amisw.com/nlt/?cc=A2M4aCAgrU3Y6xXVg7WhVmc72YDvEHJD0B8k-WOE0293vJuYTVe2FxizjRMVYJxDLQ-MhBfEyXMuFXxo12acThPkZBFSLrsXfJeE0A8cFGbAk6IBVKup9GAlogQhak-wY5UwNMgatyQU-dvoRxcaVNwMUEmnlxbO_TLfJ2Untkvc9j032V_r5sXRTvPGMKdA6RsM9fBQ7zlAy73_EkqLUoBQoluvVx45s_zTR4ov2vpVp78CZ8FRopiTKwZ5rb0c7ZND-RfomTx_0BBhiOYtImx2nvKJfk-ADUhlvgn78fCG-zx8_qs\">Mali-Russie\n : Sadio Camara et Alou Boï Diarra en mission secrète à Moscou </a><p> </p>                <br/>\n<p>08/03/2022\n</p>                    <br/>\n<p style=\"word-break:break-all\"><a href=\"https://iap-cloud.amisw.com/nlt/?cc=fbcKByAgrU3Y6xXVg7WhVmc72YDvEHJD0B8k-WOE0293vJuYTVe2FxizjRMVYJxDLQ-MhBfEyXMuFXxo12acThPkZBFSLrsXfJeE0A8cFGbAk6IBVKup9GAlogQhak-wY5UwNMgatyQU-dvoRxcaVNwMUEmnlxbO_TLfJ2Untkvc9j032V_r5sXRTvPGMKdA6RsM9fBQ7zlAy73hBE2IW4lKuVrgUAE5sf6YCoYtku0hjOFVe4UA64uFXyNq5-IxqIBV3iue6h1h9ApR1uwfYkBRv56rdUTMUFNvu0Gpx6iZrn5krfTiIDOTOHj7dQlG1FWESpBnPaGLTBuhLyQCZFWsDU1ykTDjjIDBtVkKx2olDQ\">www.jeuneafrique.com/1324996/politique/mali-russie-sadio-camara-et-alou-boi-diarra-en-mission-secrete-a-moscou/</a></p>                    <br/>\n                <br/>\n<p>Selon les informations de Jeune Afrique, le ministre malien de la Défense et le chef d&apos;état-major de l&apos;armée de l&apos;air se sont envolés pour la Russie en pleine\n guerre avec l&apos;Ukraine.</p>                <br/>\n                <br/>\n<p><a href=\"https://iap-cloud.amisw.com/nlt/?cc=ej7ihSAgrU3Y6xXVg7WhVmc72YDvEHJD0B8k-WOE0293vJuYTVe2FxizjRMVYJxDLQ-MhBfEyXMuFXxo12acThPkZBFSLrsXfJeH0w0aFGbAk6IBVKup9GAlogQhak-wY5UwNMgatyQU-dvoRxcaVNwMUEmnlxbO_TLfJ2Untkvc9j032V_r5sXRTvPGMKdA6RsM9fBQ7zlAy73_EkqLUoBQoluvVx45s_zTR4ov2vpVp78CZ8FRopiTKwZ5rb0clKMT4xfomTx_0BBhiOYtImx2iveJUFeADUhlvgn78fCG-z9__K0\"></a></p>                  <br/>\n<a href=\"https://iap-cloud.amisw.com/nlt/?cc=ej7ihSAgrU3Y6xXVg7WhVmc72YDvEHJD0B8k-WOE0293vJuYTVe2FxizjRMVYJxDLQ-MhBfEyXMuFXxo12acThPkZBFSLrsXfJeH0w0aFGbAk6IBVKup9GAlogQhak-wY5UwNMgatyQU-dvoRxcaVNwMUEmnlxbO_TLfJ2Untkvc9j032V_r5sXRTvPGMKdA6RsM9fBQ7zlAy73_EkqLUoBQoluvVx45s_zTR4ov2vpVp78CZ8FRopiTKwZ5rb0clKMT4xfomTx_0BBhiOYtImx2iveJUFeADUhlvgn78fCG-z9__K0\">Mali\n : ce que l on sait sur le charnier de Niono </a><p> </p>                <br/>\n<p>08/03/2022\n</p>                    <br/>\n<p style=\"word-break:break-all\"><a href=\"https://iap-cloud.amisw.com/nlt/?cc=m5DdciAgrU3Y6xXVg7WhVmc72YDvEHJD0B8k-WOE0293vJuYTVe2FxizjRMVYJxDLQ-MhBfEyXMuFXxo12acThPkZBFSLrsXfJeH0w0aFGbAk6IBVKup9GAlogQhak-wY5UwNMgatyQU-dvoRxcaVNwMUEmnlxbO_TLfJ2Untkvc9j032V_r5sXRTvPGMKdA6RsM9fBQ7zlAy73hBE2IW4lKuVrgUAE5sf6YCoYtku0hjOFVe4UA4ImFXyNq5-IxqIBV3iue6h1h9ApR1v0PPEJNv560e06ITB9lrgG7wLuZp29kr_DsJ3CYMmP7dQUKyE6KCZosIoo\">www.jeuneafrique.com/1324924/politique/mali-ce-que-lon-sait-sur-le-charnier-de-niono/</a></p>                    <br/>\n                <br/>\n<p>Après la découverte d&apos;au moins 35 corps calcinés près de Dogofry, au sud-ouest de Nampala, plusieurs sources locales accusent l&apos;armée, qui mène des opérations\n avec les mercenaires russes de Wagner dans la région. Mais les Fama démentent.</p>                <br/>\n                <br/>\n                <br/>\n                  <br/>\nOthers\n                <br/>\n<p><a href=\"https://iap-cloud.amisw.com/nlt/?cc=MC_WDCAgrU3Y6xXVg7WhVmc72YDvEHJD0B8k-WOE0293vJuYTVe2FxizjRMVYJxDLQ-MhBfEyXMuFXxo12acThPkZBFSLrsXfJaC3A4WFGbAk6IBVKup9GAlogQhak-wY5UwNMgatyQU-dvoRxcaVNwMUEmnlxbO_TLfJ2Untkvc9j032V_r5sXRTvPGMKdA6RsM9fBQ7zlAy73_EkqLUoBQoluvVx45s_zTR4ov2vpVp78CZ8FRopiTKwZ5rb0cjMRA7ADSmTx_0BBhiOYtImxcuP6JbmGADUhlvgn78fCG-jpw_6E\"></a></p>                  <br/>\n<a href=\"https://iap-cloud.amisw.com/nlt/?cc=MC_WDCAgrU3Y6xXVg7WhVmc72YDvEHJD0B8k-WOE0293vJuYTVe2FxizjRMVYJxDLQ-MhBfEyXMuFXxo12acThPkZBFSLrsXfJaC3A4WFGbAk6IBVKup9GAlogQhak-wY5UwNMgatyQU-dvoRxcaVNwMUEmnlxbO_TLfJ2Untkvc9j032V_r5sXRTvPGMKdA6RsM9fBQ7zlAy73_EkqLUoBQoluvVx45s_zTR4ov2vpVp78CZ8FRopiTKwZ5rb0cjMRA7ADSmTx_0BBhiOYtImxcuP6JbmGADUhlvgn78fCG-jpw_6E\">Jeune\n Afrique denounces fake front page praising Mali army </a><p> </p>                <br/>\n<p>09/03/2022\n</p>                    <br/>\n<p style=\"word-break:break-all\"><a href=\"https://iap-cloud.amisw.com/nlt/?cc=Ru1t0CAgrU3Y6xXVg7WhVmc72YDvEHJD0B8k-WOE0293vJuYTVe2FxizjRMVYJxDLQ-MhBfEyXMuFXxo12acThPkZBFSLrsXfJaC3A4WFGbAk6IBVKup9GAlogQhak-wY5UwNMgatyQU-dvoRxcaVNwMUEmnlxbO_TLfJ2Untkvc9j032V_r5sXRTvPGMKdA6RsM9fBQ7zlAy73hBE2IU45c-VzuGAY75bm7AdYEnqV6lbkCbIJ944mWWVIuvLht7Q\">www.bbc.co.uk/?ami_id=1464744651</a></p>                    <br/>\n                <br/>\n<p>A French pan-African publication, Jeune Afrique, criticised the circulation of a fake edition of its magazine dated 7 March that was widely shared online, including\n by an adviser to the Malian prime minister in a post that has since been deleted.</p>                <br/>\n                <br/>\n<p><a href=\"https://iap-cloud.amisw.com/nlt/?cc=bxkdDyAgrU3Y6xXVg7WhVmc72YDvEHJD0B8k-WOE0293vJuYTVe2FxizjRMVYJxDLQ-MhBfEyXMuFXxo12acThPkZBFSLrsXfJaD3AwXFGbAk6IBVKup9GAlogQhak-wY5UwNMgatyQU-dvoRxcaVNwMUEmnlxbO_TLfJ2Untkvc9j032V_r5sXRTvPGMKdA6RsM9fBQ7zlAy73_EkqLUoBQoluvVx45s_zTR4ov2vpVp78CZ8FRopiTKwZ5rb0cq4RU0RzCmTx_0BBhiOYtImxcvP6JQGWADUhlvgn78fCG-jtw_aA\"></a></p>                  <br/>\n<a href=\"https://iap-cloud.amisw.com/nlt/?cc=bxkdDyAgrU3Y6xXVg7WhVmc72YDvEHJD0B8k-WOE0293vJuYTVe2FxizjRMVYJxDLQ-MhBfEyXMuFXxo12acThPkZBFSLrsXfJaD3AwXFGbAk6IBVKup9GAlogQhak-wY5UwNMgatyQU-dvoRxcaVNwMUEmnlxbO_TLfJ2Untkvc9j032V_r5sXRTvPGMKdA6RsM9fBQ7zlAy73_EkqLUoBQoluvVx45s_zTR4ov2vpVp78CZ8FRopiTKwZ5rb0cq4RU0RzCmTx_0BBhiOYtImxcvP6JQGWADUhlvgn78fCG-jtw_aA\">Malian\n Army Accused of Killings, Denies Culpability </a><p> </p>                <br/>\n<p>09/03/2022\n</p>                    <br/>\n<p style=\"word-break:break-all\"><a href=\"https://iap-cloud.amisw.com/nlt/?cc=3piB3yAgrU3Y6xXVg7WhVmc72YDvEHJD0B8k-WOE0293vJuYTVe2FxizjRMVYJxDLQ-MhBfEyXMuFXxo12acThPkZBFSLrsXfJaD3AwXFGbAk6IBVKup9GAlogQhak-wY5UwNMgatyQU-dvoRxcaVNwMUEmnlxbO_TLfJ2Untkvc9j032V_r5sXRTvPGMKdA6RsM9fBQ7zlAy733H1bHV55WtF6vVRw95bm7V5EtjaF2ufVUD4MJ4I-QXlUjuL5q5MdM3yPX\">allafrica.com/stories/202203090028.html</a></p>                    <br/>\n                <br/>\n<p>Videos of an alleged massacre in central Mali are circulating on social media, with locals saying those killed were ethnic Fulani men whom security forces arrested\n in late February and early March. Mali&apos;s military this week denied any responsibility for the killings; however, VOA spoke to a man who said he witnessed troops arresting a close friend.</p>                <br/>\n                <br/>\n<p><a href=\"https://iap-cloud.amisw.com/nlt/?cc=IUVjKyAgrU3Y6xXVg7WhVmc72YDvEHJD0B8k-WOE0293vJuYTVe2FxizjRMVYJxDLQ-MhBfEyXMuFXxo12acThPkZBFSLrsXfJeL0w8bFGbAk6IBVKup9GAlogQhak-wY5UwNMgatyQU-dvoRxcaVNwMUEmnlxbO_TLfJ2Untkvc9j032V_r5sXRTvPGMKdA6RsM9fBQ7zlAy73_EkqLUoBQoluvVx45s_zTR4ov2vpVp78CZ8FRopiTKwZ5rb0cmdpP2jTomTx_0BBhiOYtImx2hfeJfhCADUhlvgn78fCG-zN__qw\"></a></p>                  <br/>\n<a href=\"https://iap-cloud.amisw.com/nlt/?cc=IUVjKyAgrU3Y6xXVg7WhVmc72YDvEHJD0B8k-WOE0293vJuYTVe2FxizjRMVYJxDLQ-MhBfEyXMuFXxo12acThPkZBFSLrsXfJeL0w8bFGbAk6IBVKup9GAlogQhak-wY5UwNMgatyQU-dvoRxcaVNwMUEmnlxbO_TLfJ2Untkvc9j032V_r5sXRTvPGMKdA6RsM9fBQ7zlAy73_EkqLUoBQoluvVx45s_zTR4ov2vpVp78CZ8FRopiTKwZ5rb0cmdpP2jTomTx_0BBhiOYtImx2hfeJfhCADUhlvgn78fCG-zN__qw\">Mauritania\n accuses Mali&apos;s army of &quot;crimes&quot; </a><p> </p>                <br/>\n<p>08/03/2022\n</p>                    <br/>\n<p style=\"word-break:break-all\"><a href=\"https://iap-cloud.amisw.com/nlt/?cc=R_j3XSAgrU3Y6xXVg7WhVmc72YDvEHJD0B8k-WOE0293vJuYTVe2FxizjRMVYJxDLQ-MhBfEyXMuFXxo12acThPkZBFSLrsXfJeL0w8bFGbAk6IBVKup9GAlogQhak-wY5UwNMgatyQU-dvoRxcaVNwMUEmnlxbO_TLfJ2Untkvc9j032V_r5sXRTvPGMKdA6RsM9fBQ7zlAy73hBE2IUIpNvlzgWBYns6WeS4hnzY4h-uJUbIN_4o6FXyMqsKtqmoRF3jzSrDpi_AcVmv0JZEBdqZ61dUzMEg0hu16lzOTbrScqvvHgMG3UZVc\">www.africanews.com/2022/03/08/mauritania-accuses-mali-s-army-of-crimes/</a></p>                    <br/>\n                <br/>\n<p>The Mauritanian Foreign ministry accused the Malian army of crimes against its nationals, on Tuesday. The ministry summoned the Malian ambassador to protest\n the recurring acts.</p>                <br/>\n                <br/>\n<p><a href=\"https://iap-cloud.amisw.com/nlt/?cc=mQNbBCAgrU3Y6xXVg7WhVmc72YDvEHJD0B8k-WOE0293vJuYTVe2FxizjRMVYJxDLQ-MhBfEyXMuFXxo12acThPkZBFSLrsXfJaC1gweFGbAk6IBVKup9GAlogQhak-wY5UwNMgatyQU-dvoRxcaVNwMUEmnlxbO_TLfJ2Untkvc9j032V_r5sXRTvPGMKdA6RsM9fBQ7zlAy73_EkqLUoBQoluvVx45s_zTR4ov2vpVp78CZ8FRopiTKwZ5rb0cmJkU2xv4mTx_0BBhiOYtImxcuPSJQEeADUhlvgn78fCG-jp6_ak\"></a></p>                  <br/>\n<a href=\"https://iap-cloud.amisw.com/nlt/?cc=mQNbBCAgrU3Y6xXVg7WhVmc72YDvEHJD0B8k-WOE0293vJuYTVe2FxizjRMVYJxDLQ-MhBfEyXMuFXxo12acThPkZBFSLrsXfJaC1gweFGbAk6IBVKup9GAlogQhak-wY5UwNMgatyQU-dvoRxcaVNwMUEmnlxbO_TLfJ2Untkvc9j032V_r5sXRTvPGMKdA6RsM9fBQ7zlAy73_EkqLUoBQoluvVx45s_zTR4ov2vpVp78CZ8FRopiTKwZ5rb0cmJkU2xv4mTx_0BBhiOYtImxcuPSJQEeADUhlvgn78fCG-jp6_ak\">La\n Mauritanie accuse l&apos;armée malienne de crimes &quot;récurrents&quot; contre ses ressortissants\n</a><p> </p>                <br/>\n<p>08/03/2022\n</p>                    <br/>\n<p style=\"word-break:break-all\"><a href=\"https://iap-cloud.amisw.com/nlt/?cc=Uf4E4SAgrU3Y6xXVg7WhVmc72YDvEHJD0B8k-WOE0293vJuYTVe2FxizjRMVYJxDLQ-MhBfEyXMuFXxo12acThPkZBFSLrsXfJaC1gweFGbAk6IBVKup9GAlogQhak-wY5UwNMgatyQU-dvoRxcaVNwMUEmnlxbO_TLfJ2Untkvc9j032V_r5sXRTvPGMKdA6RsM9fBQ7zlAy73hBE2IV55euVzkBEd-o-SQAdcEmbo2-JZDe4R64ZiSWCQj5ecrr4BLxT2e6h1m-hNKlf8GPFdd99_1dUbXVg95vwn68_uE-Th5_6i1eHKQeny3ZBJO0kaLDpAkca-BShutbSYCdkKiWhozty6nk9jv_19I3y57Igq22yijUhma_-mscvKQ3--WvSvcdAKjo2zF1Yw47fm3ZBawV1G-MD7PcqGStB0zebmJhvshH96pubPunw\">www.france24.com/fr/%C3%A9missions/journal-de-l-afrique/20220308-la-mauritanie-accuse-l-arm%C3%A9e-malienne-de-crimes-r%C3%A9currents-contre-ses-ressortissants</a></p>                    <br/>\n                <br/>\n<p>La Mauritanie hausse le ton contre son voisin malien, accusant son armée de crimes &quot;récurrents&quot; sur le sol malien contre des Mauritaniens. Le ministère mauritanien\n des Affaires étrangères a indiqué avoir convoqué l&apos;ambassadeur du Mali Mohamed Dibassy et lui avoir signifié sa &quot;vive protestation contre les récents actes criminels récurrents&quot; commis selon lui par l&apos;armée malienne contre des Mauritaniens.</p>                <br/>\n                <br/>\n<p><a href=\"https://iap-cloud.amisw.com/nlt/?cc=3_VZ6SAgrU3Y6xXVg7WhVmc72YDvEHJD0B8k-WOE0293vJuYTVe2FxizjRMVYJxDLQ-MhBfEyXMuFXxo12acThPkZBFSLrsXfJaC0w8YFGbAk6IBVKup9GAlogQhak-wY5UwNMgatyQU-dvoRxcaVNwMUEmnlxbO_TLfJ2Untkvc9j032V_r5sXRTvPGMKdA6RsM9fBQ7zlAy73_EkqLUoBQoluvVx45s_zTR4ov2vpVp78CZ8FRopiTKwZ5rb0cpYFDzxromTx_0BBhiOYtImxcuPeJfhSADUhlvgn78fCG-jp__q8\"></a></p>                  <br/>\n<a href=\"https://iap-cloud.amisw.com/nlt/?cc=3_VZ6SAgrU3Y6xXVg7WhVmc72YDvEHJD0B8k-WOE0293vJuYTVe2FxizjRMVYJxDLQ-MhBfEyXMuFXxo12acThPkZBFSLrsXfJaC0w8YFGbAk6IBVKup9GAlogQhak-wY5UwNMgatyQU-dvoRxcaVNwMUEmnlxbO_TLfJ2Untkvc9j032V_r5sXRTvPGMKdA6RsM9fBQ7zlAy73_EkqLUoBQoluvVx45s_zTR4ov2vpVp78CZ8FRopiTKwZ5rb0cpYFDzxromTx_0BBhiOYtImxcuPeJfhSADUhlvgn78fCG-jp__q8\">Attaque\n de Mondoro au Mali: les jihadistes du Jnim et Bamako présentent des bilans différents\n</a><p> </p>                <br/>\n<p>08/03/2022\n</p>                    <br/>\n<p style=\"word-break:break-all\"><a href=\"https://iap-cloud.amisw.com/nlt/?cc=Cx9QDCAgrU3Y6xXVg7WhVmc72YDvEHJD0B8k-WOE0293vJuYTVe2FxizjRMVYJxDLQ-MhBfEyXMuFXxo12acThPkZBFSLrsXfJaC0w8YFGbAk6IBVKup9GAlogQhak-wY5UwNMgatyQU-dvoRxcaVNwMUEmnlxbO_TLfJ2Untkvc9j032V_r5sXRTvPGMKdA6RsM9fBQ7zlAy73hBE2IQ4pW-VnzE0EWpvnYFqMjmbp6u6UDbIN_4I2SX1UpuLZ1vZ1Qyj_OvXZo8EtVlPAOfkFX99KtOU3EUxchtkm7mKPdo2stpev5MG3cM2T7ew5OywqAE9hrcaGDVAflMDgKJQWMTA00wVy70ojAsl8LxmJzLhz11yTiVxLEsf-sefHGwKjwvDutcmao5EiSwoo\">www.rfi.fr/fr/afrique/20220308-attaque-de-mondoro-au-mali-les-jihadistes-du-jnim-et-bamako-pr%C3%A9sentent-des-bilans-diff%C3%A9rents</a></p>                    <br/>\n                <br/>\n<p>Mardi, le Groupe de soutien à l&apos;islam et aux musulmans (Jnim ou GSIM), lié à al-Qaïda au Maghreb islamique, a revendiqué l&apos;attaque particulièrement sanglante\n de Mondoro dans des vidéos et un audio diffusés sur les réseaux sociaux. Une revendication rapide et hors des canaux habituels, comme cela arrive parfois pour les opérations d&apos;ampleur. Les jihadistes y contredisent les bilans donnés par l&apos;armée malienne.</p>                <br/>\n                <br/>\n<p><a href=\"https://iap-cloud.amisw.com/nlt/?cc=AiO4bCAgrU3Y6xXVg7WhVmc72YDvEHJD0B8k-WOE0293vJuYTVe2FxizjRMVYJxDLQ-MhBfEyXMuFXxo12acThPkZBFSLrsXfJaC3Q0eFGbAk6IBVKup9GAlogQhak-wY5UwNMgatyQU-dvoRxcaVNwMUEmnlxbO_TLfJ2Untkvc9j032V_r5sXRTvPGMKdA6RsM9fBQ7zlAy73_EkqLUoBQoluvVx45s_zTR4ov2vpVp78CZ8FRopiTKwZ5rb0cm9B0mHb4mTx_0BBhiOYtImxcuP2JUEeADUhlvgn78fCG-jpx_Kk\"></a></p>                  <br/>\n<a href=\"https://iap-cloud.amisw.com/nlt/?cc=AiO4bCAgrU3Y6xXVg7WhVmc72YDvEHJD0B8k-WOE0293vJuYTVe2FxizjRMVYJxDLQ-MhBfEyXMuFXxo12acThPkZBFSLrsXfJaC3Q0eFGbAk6IBVKup9GAlogQhak-wY5UwNMgatyQU-dvoRxcaVNwMUEmnlxbO_TLfJ2Untkvc9j032V_r5sXRTvPGMKdA6RsM9fBQ7zlAy73_EkqLUoBQoluvVx45s_zTR4ov2vpVp78CZ8FRopiTKwZ5rb0cm9B0mHb4mTx_0BBhiOYtImxcuP2JUEeADUhlvgn78fCG-jpx_Kk\">La\n Mauritanie en colère après des disparitions à la frontière avec le Mali </a><p> </p>                <br/>\n<p>08/03/2022\n</p>                    <br/>\n<p style=\"word-break:break-all\"><a href=\"https://iap-cloud.amisw.com/nlt/?cc=sBwgyyAgrU3Y6xXVg7WhVmc72YDvEHJD0B8k-WOE0293vJuYTVe2FxizjRMVYJxDLQ-MhBfEyXMuFXxo12acThPkZBFSLrsXfJaC3Q0eFGbAk6IBVKup9GAlogQhak-wY5UwNMgatyQU-dvoRxcaVNwMUEmnlxbO_TLfJ2Untkvc9j032V_r5sXRTvPGMKdA6RsM9fBQ7zlAy73hBE2IQ4pW-VnzE0EWpvnYFqMjmbp6u6UDbIN_4I2SX1UpuLZ1sIgJxi_OqjJ49AhRnrMPfx5btd_9JhXmDFs-723wx6yZqno76aq4Fi3UZSSXKRMKwkKWSpFgY7yDTQG8KSVBZB3qTR1FxziwlKye61YEnyllJAGs3Gi8Az-EuanwXq-Rl7DS-Xv8akv0u0Cd2pA\">www.rfi.fr/fr/afrique/20220308-la-mauritanie-en-col%C3%A8re-apr%C3%A8s-des-disparitions-%C3%A0-la-fronti%C3%A8re-avec-le-mali</a></p>                    <br/>\n                <br/>\n<p>Tensions entre la Mauritanie et le Mali, suite à la disparition d&apos;éleveurs mauritaniens en territoire malien. Plusieurs dizaines de Mauritaniens sont portés\n disparus depuis près de trois jours. Des sources locales affirment qu&apos;ils auraient été tués par des soldats maliens, des accusations qui n&apos;ont pour l&apos;heure pas été confirmées.</p>                <br/>\n                <br/>\n<p><a href=\"https://iap-cloud.amisw.com/nlt/?cc=E-90tSAgrU3Y6xXVg7WhVmc72YDvEHJD0B8k-WOE0293vJuYTVe2FxizjRMVYJxDLQ-MhBfEyXMuFXxo12acThPkZBFSLrsXfJaD1QofFGbAk6IBVKup9GAlogQhak-wY5UwNMgatyQU-dvoRxcaVNwMUEmnlxbO_TLfJ2Untkvc9j032V_r5sXRTvPGMKdA6RsM9fBQ7zlAy73_EkqLUoBQoluvVx45s_zTR4ov2vpVp78CZ8FRopiTKwZ5rb0csL1UxSj4mTx_0BBhiOYtImxcvPWKbkuADUhlvgn78fCG-jt5-6g\"></a></p>                  <br/>\n<a href=\"https://iap-cloud.amisw.com/nlt/?cc=E-90tSAgrU3Y6xXVg7WhVmc72YDvEHJD0B8k-WOE0293vJuYTVe2FxizjRMVYJxDLQ-MhBfEyXMuFXxo12acThPkZBFSLrsXfJaD1QofFGbAk6IBVKup9GAlogQhak-wY5UwNMgatyQU-dvoRxcaVNwMUEmnlxbO_TLfJ2Untkvc9j032V_r5sXRTvPGMKdA6RsM9fBQ7zlAy73_EkqLUoBQoluvVx45s_zTR4ov2vpVp78CZ8FRopiTKwZ5rb0csL1UxSj4mTx_0BBhiOYtImxcvPWKbkuADUhlvgn78fCG-jt5-6g\">Mauritania\n summons Malian envoy over alleged killing of its nationals in Mali </a><p> </p>                <br/>\n<p>08/03/2022\n</p>                    <br/>\n<p style=\"word-break:break-all\"><a href=\"https://iap-cloud.amisw.com/nlt/?cc=M3YhOiAgrU3Y6xXVg7WhVmc72YDvEHJD0B8k-WOE0293vJuYTVe2FxizjRMVYJxDLQ-MhBfEyXMuFXxo12acThPkZBFSLrsXfJaD1QofFGbAk6IBVKup9GAlogQhak-wY5UwNMgatyQU-dvoRxcaVNwMUEmnlxbO_TLfJ2Untkvc9j032V_r5sXRTvPGMKdA6RsM9fBQ7zlAy73hBE2IU45c-VzuGAY75bm7AdYEnqV6lbkCbIJ944uRVVIosLdo7w\">www.bbc.co.uk/?ami_id=1618728903</a></p>                    <br/>\n                <br/>\n<p>Mauritania&apos;s foreign ministry has summoned the Malian ambassador, Mohamed Debassi, - a diplomatic move to signal concern or protest - following allegations about\n the disappearance of a group of Mauritanian citizens in neighbouring Mali and rumours circulating about their alleged killing by the Malian army, Sahara Media reported late on 8 March.</p>                <br/>\n                <br/>\n<p><a href=\"https://iap-cloud.amisw.com/nlt/?cc=ECuhcyAgrU3Y6xXVg7WhVmc72YDvEHJD0B8k-WOE0293vJuYTVe2FxizjRMVYJxDLQ-MhBfEyXMuFXxo12acThPkZBFSLrsXfJeL0wocFGbAk6IBVKup9GAlogQhak-wY5UwNMgatyQU-dvoRxcaVNwMUEmnlxbO_TLfJ2Untkvc9j032V_r5sXRTvPGMKdA6RsM9fBQ7zlAy73_EkqLUoBQoluvVx45s_zTR4ov2vpVp78CZ8FRopiTKwZ5rb0c5K5U5wXCmTx_0BBhiOYtImx2hfeKbk-ADUhlvgn78fCG-zN_-6s\"></a></p>                  <br/>\n<a href=\"https://iap-cloud.amisw.com/nlt/?cc=ECuhcyAgrU3Y6xXVg7WhVmc72YDvEHJD0B8k-WOE0293vJuYTVe2FxizjRMVYJxDLQ-MhBfEyXMuFXxo12acThPkZBFSLrsXfJeL0wocFGbAk6IBVKup9GAlogQhak-wY5UwNMgatyQU-dvoRxcaVNwMUEmnlxbO_TLfJ2Untkvc9j032V_r5sXRTvPGMKdA6RsM9fBQ7zlAy73_EkqLUoBQoluvVx45s_zTR4ov2vpVp78CZ8FRopiTKwZ5rb0c5K5U5wXCmTx_0BBhiOYtImx2hfeKbk-ADUhlvgn78fCG-zN_-6s\">Peacekeepers\n and soldiers killed in attacks in Mali </a><p> </p>                <br/>\n<p>08/03/2022\n</p>                    <br/>\n<p style=\"word-break:break-all\"><a href=\"https://iap-cloud.amisw.com/nlt/?cc=0eGLEyAgrU3Y6xXVg7WhVmc72YDvEHJD0B8k-WOE0293vJuYTVe2FxizjRMVYJxDLQ-MhBfEyXMuFXxo12acThPkZBFSLrsXfJeL0wocFGbAk6IBVKup9GAlogQhak-wY5UwNMgatyQU-dvoRxcaVNwMUEmnlxbO_TLfJ2Untkvc9j032V_r5sXRTvPGMKdA6RsM9fBQ7zlAy73hBE2IUIpNvlzgWBYns6WeS4hnzY4h-uJUbIN_4o6FXyMqsKtqmplByi3esz5p5QNKiLMLf1cVqdy0cEnATQ0hsUWk2azQ5mMn4fn5IX-SPGL7eA4Ky0aJDtA7Vg\">www.africanews.com/2022/03/08/peacekeepers-and-soldiers-killed-in-attacks-in-mali/</a></p>                    <br/>\n                <br/>\n<p>Two Egyptian peacekeepers of the United Nations Mission in Mali (MINUSMA) and two Malian soldiers were killed on Monday morning in two separate events in Mali,\n the UN and the Malian army announced.</p>                <br/>\n                <br/>\n            <br/>\n         <br/>\n       <br/>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:center;line-height:7.5pt\">EEAS   INTCEN 2 compiles this Newsletter for information purposes only. The views expressed in this review are strictly those of the cited media organisations and are do not reflect\n those of the EEAS. Neither the EU nor anyone acting on behalf of the EU is responsible for the accuracy of these views or the use which might be made of the information contained in the Newsletter. Further distribution is not allowed.\n</p>           <br/>\n       <br/>\n    <br/>\n<p> </p>   <br/>\n</body></html>"
